Package: rpackit
Title: Check and Package R Applications
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Inspects R application projects and the local build environment
    before packaging. The initial release recognizes common Shiny layouts,
    discovers package and runtime requirements, and recommends portable
    desktop, static web, and dynamic server targets.
